<title>USA: Citizens Bank buy 3 Metropolitan branches.</title>
<headline>Citizens Bank buy 3 Metropolitan branches.</headline>
<dateline>YOUNGSTOWN, Ohio 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citizens Bancshares Inc said Tuesday that it will buy three branches from Metropolitan Savings Bank of Ohio in a transaction valued at about $6 million.</p>
<p>Citizens said it will acquire about $66 million in deposits and $26 million in loans for a nine percent premium on the deposits.</p>
